WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A road scene has ended. The witness has only a memory.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
One question says the cars hit. Another says they smashed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Participants' speed estimates differed with question wording.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A later, absent detail became part of some reports.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Later research confirmed susceptibility while mechanisms remain debated.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Record what was seen before recording what was suggested.
